Public data sources (queried over HTTPS, no API keys):
- Federal Tax Service of Russia, EGRUL/EGRIP: https://egrul.nalog.ru/
- Federal Tax Service of Russia, Transparent Business: https://pb.nalog.ru/
The returned data and PDF documents originate from FNS; this project does not
claim authorship of registry content. Source dates and raw responses are kept.

Runtime components and pinned versions: see requirements.txt.
- pdfplumber: PDF text/table extraction, https://github.com/jsvine/pdfplumber
- pdfminer.six: PDF parser, https://github.com/pdfminer/pdfminer.six
- Pillow: image support, https://python-pillow.org/
- pypdfium2: PDFium bindings, https://github.com/pypdfium2-team/pypdfium2
- charset-normalizer, cryptography, cffi, pycparser: transitive dependencies.
Their upstream license files are included in the respective distributions.

No LLMs, external paid APIs or purchased datasets are used.
Network substitutes and the synthetic PDF in tests are test fixtures only.
